# Baseline — the greedy claimer bundled with Singular.
# One rule per scroll. Rules evaluate in file order; the first matching
# rule with a legal action fires. If none fire, the player attunes.

WHEN here unclaimed DO inscribe "singular light lattice woven bright amber"
WHEN here enemy DO inscribe "mutation turns the scroll toward the light"
WHEN unclaimed adjacent DO move toward unclaimed
WHEN charge >= 10 DO move toward unclaimed
WHEN always DO attune
